# Contributors

This file lists people who have contributed code to AgentOS.

Contributions are accepted under the Contributor Licence Agreement in
.github/CLA.md, signed with a "Signed-off-by" trailer (git commit -s).

Contributors retain the copyright in their own work. The agreement grants a
licence broad enough for the project to distribute contributions in both the
Apache-2.0 open-source core and the commercial edition. It is a licence, not
an assignment: you remain free to use your own contribution elsewhere on any
terms.

Contributions made before the adoption of the CLA were submitted under the
project's then-current dual "MIT OR Apache-2.0" terms.
